1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,471
All five on one card.

2
00:00:01,471 --> 00:00:07,057
Auxin, from the shoot apex: elongation and apical dominance.

3
00:00:07,057 --> 00:00:10,950
Gibberellin: internode elongation and bolting.

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:16,796
Cytokinin, from the root apex: cell division, and it delays ageing.

5
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:21,393
Abscisic acid: closes stomata and keeps seeds dormant.

6
00:00:21,393 --> 00:00:25,273
And ethylene: ripens fruit and makes leaves fall.

